<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:05.239" end="00:00:07.259" style="s2">[crying and laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.600" end="00:00:12.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, my lady. It&#39;s a girl.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.000" end="00:00:15.800" style="s2">Let me hold her.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.100" end="00:00:21.300" style="s2">I&#39;ll take the little miss to see the</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.400" end="00:00:21.300" style="s2">duke and be right back.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.100" end="00:00:47.800" style="s2">Is this baby going to make our lives</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.500" end="00:00:50.300" style="s2">better?</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.800" end="00:00:53.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your daughter was born unlucky.</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.300" end="00:00:57.100" style="s2">She&#39;ll only bring disaster.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.500" end="00:00:57.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about that [ __ ] Isabella&#39;s kid?</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.500" end="00:01:01.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isabella&#39;s daughter has lady luck on her</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.700" end="00:01:03.600" style="s2">side. She brings good luck to everyone</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.900" end="00:01:05.300" style="s2">around her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.600" end="00:01:07.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re good luck, so you&#39;re staying with</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.300" end="00:01:10.900" style="s2">me. My daughter goes to the duke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.200" end="00:01:10.900" style="s2">estate. She&#39;ll be the real little lady.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.500" end="00:01:18.600" style="s2">I thought I saw a mark by her temple.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.000" end="00:01:20.620" style="s2">Did I imagine it?</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.600" end="00:01:20.620" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.220" end="00:01:23.240" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.805" end="00:01:27.825" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.045" end="00:01:35.200" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.900" end="00:01:38.000" style="s2">Quickly, don&#39;t let the lady see.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.200" end="00:01:38.000" style="s2">Thank you, miss.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.216" end="00:01:42.236" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.300" end="00:01:47.600" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this the ring I&#39;ve been looking</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.400" end="00:01:49.600" style="s2">for?</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.600" end="00:01:51.700" style="s2">Who said you could give her food?</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.600" end="00:01:55.000" style="s2">Morgan said she brings luck.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.700" end="00:01:58.000" style="s2">Six years, not one good thing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.000" end="00:02:00.392" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll just take Isabella&#39;s baby.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.000" end="00:02:02.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It won&#39;t work. That power only works if</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.392" end="00:02:06.192" style="s2">truly [music] love the child.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.192" end="00:02:07.892" style="s2">Take her by force, and it&#39;ll backfire.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.192" end="00:02:10.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She looks more and more like that [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.892" end="00:02:10.492" style="s2">Isabella.</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.792" end="00:02:15.392" style="s2">Little Jinx, want to go out and play?</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.292" end="00:02:18.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to go.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.392" end="00:02:18.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t get a say.</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.092" end="00:02:29.092" style="s2">You stand right here and wait for me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.792" end="00:02:32.692" style="s2">I&#39;ll be back soon. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.092" end="00:02:32.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, can I come with you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.092" end="00:02:38.692" style="s2">Mommy!</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.092" end="00:02:41.292" style="s2">Don&#39;t leave me!</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.692" end="00:02:44.192" style="s2">I&#39;ll be good, I promise. I won&#39;t eat</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.292" end="00:02:44.192" style="s2">ever again!</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.371" end="00:02:48.391" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.192" end="00:02:56.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t cry. Mommy hates it when I cry.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.492" end="00:03:01.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, someone&#39;s there.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.192" end="00:03:05.792" style="s2">That&#39;s Mark.</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.692" end="00:03:22.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP THE CARRIAGE!</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.432" end="00:03:22.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.462" end="00:03:41.447" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.427" end="00:03:41.447" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.892" end="00:03:52.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.092" end="00:03:56.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ARE THOSE BEARS BRINGING HER FOOD?</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.592" end="00:04:04.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s weird. I&#39;ve never met this child</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.892" end="00:04:06.094" style="s2">before, but somehow she feels familiar.</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.394" end="00:04:06.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetie, what are you doing out here all</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.094" end="00:04:08.694" style="s2">alone?</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.694" end="00:04:08.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy put me out of the coach and drove</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.694" end="00:04:10.294" style="s2">off.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.902" end="00:04:13.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.294" end="00:04:13.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me, what&#39;s your name?</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.394" end="00:04:16.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have a name.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.794" end="00:04:18.294" style="s2">Mommy just [music] calls me a little</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.994" end="00:04:19.394" style="s2">Jinx.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.294" end="00:04:21.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of mother would do that?</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.394" end="00:04:22.594" style="s2">That&#39;s horrible.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.347" end="00:04:24.894" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.594" end="00:04:24.894" style="s2">Mother?</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.494" end="00:04:26.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your condition&#39;s [music] getting worse</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.494" end="00:04:28.794" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.794" end="00:04:31.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.794" end="00:04:31.894" style="s2">Please get better soon.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.994" end="00:04:40.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.294" end="00:04:43.394" style="s2">I&#39;m okay now.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.294" end="00:04:44.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she stays here, she won&#39;t make it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.394" end="00:04:46.494" style="s2">Do you want [music] to come home with</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.294" end="00:04:46.494" style="s2">us?</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.394" end="00:04:51.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady, really?</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.494" end="00:04:52.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, we&#39;re family.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.294" end="00:04:56.894" style="s2">You&#39;re a young lady of the Duke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.494" end="00:04:56.894" style="s2">estate. We&#39;ll call you Avie, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.394" end="00:05:00.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.094" end="00:05:03.194" style="s2">Avie.</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.794" end="00:05:03.194" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.794" end="00:05:23.494" style="s2">Mum, why are you back so late? I&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.794" end="00:05:24.494" style="s2">waiting forever.</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.494" end="00:05:28.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where [music] did this little beggar</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.494" end="00:05:28.394" style="s2">come from? You don&#39;t belong here.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.468" end="00:05:34.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.694" end="00:05:34.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady, are you feeling unwell again?</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.794" end="00:05:41.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch my mum.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.794" end="00:05:43.878" style="s2">Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.913" end="00:05:45.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.878" end="00:05:45.898" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.694" end="00:05:52.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca, don&#39;t say that.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.594" end="00:05:55.694" style="s2">Didn&#39;t I tell you to be kind to others?</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.794" end="00:05:56.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mum, I don&#39;t want some dirty girl living</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.694" end="00:06:00.494" style="s2">in our house.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.794" end="00:06:00.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca, [music] stop making a scene.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.494" end="00:06:10.495" style="s2">[snorts] Not feeling well again?</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.995" end="00:06:10.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.195" end="00:06:15.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is this child?</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.495" end="00:06:17.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her name is Evie. Her own mother</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.495" end="00:06:19.295" style="s2">abandoned her in the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.695" end="00:06:20.595" style="s2">I want her to stay with us.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.295" end="00:06:22.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, of course.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.595" end="00:06:25.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want her to stay. I don&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.695" end="00:06:25.495" style="s2">to live with her.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.895" end="00:06:28.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother!</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.795" end="00:06:32.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady!</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.995" end="00:06:32.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get the doctor, now!</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.279" end="00:06:39.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.595" end="00:06:41.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The lady&#39;s in bad shape. I&#39;m afraid she</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.095" end="00:06:42.995" style="s2">doesn&#39;t have long.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.495" end="00:06:44.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever it takes,</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.995" end="00:06:45.195" style="s2">save her.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.195" end="00:06:48.595" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.195" end="00:06:48.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t leave me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.195" end="00:06:55.395" style="s2">My lady,</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.995" end="00:06:55.395" style="s2">please get better soon.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.595" end="00:07:01.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you touch my mom.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.995" end="00:07:06.095" style="s2">It&#39;s all your fault. Mom got worse the</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.395" end="00:07:08.895" style="s2">moment you showed up.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.095" end="00:07:08.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.095" end="00:07:13.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take Evie outside for now.</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.395" end="00:07:15.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father, Evie was just worried about</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.095" end="00:07:17.995" style="s2">mother. Don&#39;t be so hard on her.</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.995" end="00:07:20.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. Right now, your mother comes</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.995" end="00:07:20.395" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.595" end="00:07:33.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a miracle. The lady&#39;s condition has</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.495" end="00:07:36.195" style="s2">stabilized.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.695" end="00:07:36.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank God.</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.895" end="00:07:39.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.695" end="00:07:43.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t want the noise to [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.495" end="00:07:46.395" style="s2">bother you, so I had them take Evie out</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.995" end="00:07:46.395" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.695" end="00:07:50.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evie is a poor child.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.995" end="00:07:51.995" style="s2">We should treat her kindly.</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.395" end="00:07:54.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Were you the one holding my hand and</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.995" end="00:07:57.195" style="s2">asking me to get better?</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.995" end="00:07:59.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, it was me. I was the one calling</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.195" end="00:08:01.295" style="s2">you. You must have heard wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.895" end="00:08:03.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little beggar like you thinks she can</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.295" end="00:08:05.395" style="s2">stay in my home? I&#39;ll get you thrown</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.095" end="00:08:05.395" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.095" end="00:08:10.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t expect her to look so much like</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.397" end="00:08:13.097" style="s2">you when she cleaned up.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.897" end="00:08:13.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She does. Avie, come here. How did you</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.097" end="00:08:17.097" style="s2">sleep?</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.897" end="00:08:18.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very well. The room was so big and warm.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.097" end="00:08:20.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was only a guest room. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.497" end="00:08:22.390" style="s2">We&#39;ll have your new room ready today.</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.297" end="00:08:24.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need, my lady. The room&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.390" end="00:08:26.297" style="s2">[music] It even has a bed. Never slept</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.297" end="00:08:29.597" style="s2">in one before.</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.297" end="00:08:29.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve suffered so much, child.</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.897" end="00:08:36.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my seat. You can sit next to me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.097" end="00:08:45.097" style="s2">Oops. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.997" end="00:08:45.097" style="s2">You should be more careful.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.297" end="00:08:55.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca, [music] stop.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.397" end="00:09:00.697" style="s2">Why is she nothing like me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.097" end="00:09:04.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca, apologize to Avie now. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.697" end="00:09:05.797" style="s2">She&#39;s your sister now. Treat her right.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.097" end="00:09:07.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. [music] I was only playing</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.797" end="00:09:09.097" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.497" end="00:09:11.797" style="s2">How about I take you to the garden after</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.097" end="00:09:11.797" style="s2">breakfast?</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.397" end="00:09:18.697" style="s2">Just wait, you little beggar.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.897" end="00:09:23.497" style="s2">Dad gave these roses to mom. They&#39;re her</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.697" end="00:09:25.497" style="s2">favorite.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.497" end="00:09:27.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? They&#39;re so pretty.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.497" end="00:09:29.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I water them every day. Keep them happy,</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.697" end="00:09:31.097" style="s2">mother&#39;s happy. Maybe she&#39;ll get better</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.397" end="00:09:34.797" style="s2">faster.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.097" end="00:09:34.797" style="s2">Want to try? Give them some water.</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.297" end="00:09:52.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, something terrible happened.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.997" end="00:09:55.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.997" end="00:09:57.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie killed all your favorite roses.</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.497" end="00:09:57.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That can&#39;t be true. Avie wouldn&#39;t do</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.097" end="00:10:00.197" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.497" end="00:10:03.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is. I saw it myself. I tried to stop</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.197" end="00:10:05.297" style="s2">her, but she pushed me down.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.097" end="00:10:07.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca, you&#39;re lying again.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.297" end="00:10:07.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.697" end="00:10:14.098" style="s2">If If don&#39;t believe me, come see for</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.298" end="00:10:14.098" style="s2">yourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.298" end="00:10:21.898" style="s2">Avery came, mom got sick. Now the roses</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.398" end="00:10:21.898" style="s2">are dead too. She&#39;s a jinx.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.598" end="00:10:45.698" style="s2">My lady, why you all here?</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.598" end="00:10:46.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca, these flowers look perfectly</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.698" end="00:10:48.298" style="s2">fine.</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.798" end="00:10:50.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.298" end="00:10:52.098" style="s2">They were all dead just moments ago.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.198" end="00:10:54.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady, she isn&#39;t lying. The roses</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.098" end="00:10:56.098" style="s2">really did wilt. I asked them to get</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.298" end="00:10:57.898" style="s2">better and they bloomed [music] again.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.098" end="00:10:59.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think Bianca set this whole thing up</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.898" end="00:11:02.098" style="s2">just to get Avery punished. Mom favors</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.998" end="00:11:04.198" style="s2">her. Arthur protects her.</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.098" end="00:11:05.098" style="s2">She stays. She&#39;ll take everything from</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.198" end="00:11:08.798" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.098" end="00:11:09.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avery, did you push Bianca down?</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.798" end="00:11:11.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.798" end="00:11:13.347" style="s2">She fell on her own. I tried to help</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.798" end="00:11:13.598" style="s2">her, but we both ended up in the mud.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.347" end="00:11:16.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.598" end="00:11:19.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did you say Avery pushed you?</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.898" end="00:11:20.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We were the only ones here. I panicked</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.098" end="00:11:22.298" style="s2">and assumed it was her fault.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.498" end="00:11:23.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca, no more lying.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.298" end="00:11:25.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.098" end="00:11:28.098" style="s2">Your sisters get along from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.398" end="00:11:28.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.498" end="00:11:32.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still think you&#39;re the precious little</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.598" end="00:11:32.098" style="s2">lady here?</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.398" end="00:11:42.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom favors her. Arthur protects her. She</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.198" end="00:11:42.298" style="s2">stays. She&#39;ll take everything from me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.898" end="00:11:50.798" style="s2">Avery, you&#39;re not staying here tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.598" end="00:11:52.598" style="s2">Mom found you a new room. Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.798" end="00:11:55.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.598" end="00:11:57.298" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t my lady tell me herself?</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.698" end="00:12:00.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little beggar.</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.298" end="00:12:00.598" style="s2">You think mother would come herself?</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.398" end="00:12:13.099" style="s2">Go on. This is your new room.</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.643" end="00:12:16.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.099" end="00:12:18.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s so dark. Did my lady really send me</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.599" end="00:12:18.799" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.899" end="00:12:24.699" style="s2">Bianca, let me out.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.899" end="00:12:34.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time no one&#39;s [music] going to find</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.699" end="00:12:34.899" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.399" end="00:12:42.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s so dark and so cold.</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.799" end="00:12:48.199" style="s2">My lady, Arthur, where are you?</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.399" end="00:12:52.308" style="s2">I can&#39;t stay here and die.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.288" end="00:12:52.308" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.499" end="00:13:04.599" style="s2">Help!</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.299" end="00:13:04.599" style="s2">THERE&#39;S A FIRE!</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.799" end="00:13:09.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FATHER, MOTHER, AVIE&#39;S MISSING.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.499" end="00:13:10.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean [music] she&#39;s missing?</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.599" end="00:13:13.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I couldn&#39;t sleep so I went to check on</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.999" end="00:13:14.499" style="s2">her. She wasn&#39;t in her room.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.199" end="00:13:16.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you ask the night servants?</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.499" end="00:13:19.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one saw her leave.</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.299" end="00:13:19.299" style="s2">It has to be Bianca.</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.099" end="00:13:24.999" style="s2">Bianca, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.399" end="00:13:27.999" style="s2">what did you do with Avie?</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.999" end="00:13:30.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s missing. Why are you asking me?</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.999" end="00:13:34.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where have you been this late? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.699" end="00:13:37.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I couldn&#39;t sleep so I went for a walk.</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.899" end="00:13:40.699" style="s2">Mommy, I really don&#39;t [music] know.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.299" end="00:13:40.699" style="s2">Why would you even suspect me?</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.799" end="00:13:46.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, over there.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.299" end="00:13:53.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie!</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.299" end="00:13:56.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s too dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.299" end="00:13:56.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie, are you in there?</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.399" end="00:14:03.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s the key?</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.199" end="00:14:04.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.099" end="00:14:07.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie, hold on. We&#39;re coming.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.499" end="00:14:07.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Break it open.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.299" end="00:14:12.819" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca, if anything happens to Avie,</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.999" end="00:14:12.999" style="s2">you&#39;re dead.</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.819" end="00:14:15.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.999" end="00:14:15.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.599" end="00:14:17.699" style="s2">Avie!</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.101" end="00:14:24.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on, Avy. I&#39;ve got you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.701" end="00:14:40.301" style="s2">Get the doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.601" end="00:14:48.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was Bianca. She did this to Avy.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.601" end="00:14:51.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t me. I just saw Avy go to the</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.901" end="00:14:53.601" style="s2">cellar. Who knows what really happened?</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.601" end="00:14:55.201" style="s2">Ever since Avy got here, Arthur&#39;s blamed</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.601" end="00:14:56.601" style="s2">me for everything.</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.201" end="00:14:58.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Arthur,</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.601" end="00:14:59.801" style="s2">Bianca may be spoiled, [music] but she</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.001" end="00:15:00.901" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t go this far.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.801" end="00:15:02.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father,</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.901" end="00:15:04.301" style="s2">how long are you going to keep believing</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.101" end="00:15:04.301" style="s2">her?</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.601" end="00:15:06.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.901" end="00:15:08.801" style="s2">Let me out.</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.901" end="00:15:10.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avy, what did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.801" end="00:15:13.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca,</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.201" end="00:15:13.101" style="s2">let me out.</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.601" end="00:15:21.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you have to say for yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.801" end="00:15:22.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t me. She&#39;s dreaming. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.001" end="00:15:25.201" style="s2">framing me.</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.801" end="00:15:25.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neil.</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.901" end="00:15:29.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you&#39;ve never yelled at me like</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.501" end="00:15:30.501" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.001" end="00:15:31.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you&#39;ve never done anything this</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.501" end="00:15:32.501" style="s2">cruel.</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.601" end="00:15:33.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll stay with Sister [music] Mary</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.501" end="00:15:34.901" style="s2">until you truly understand what you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.801" end="00:15:37.201" style="s2">done.</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.901" end="00:15:39.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, please. I don&#39;t want to go to that</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.201" end="00:15:39.901" style="s2">AWFUL NUN.</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.601" end="00:15:43.901" style="s2">DAD.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.601" end="00:15:43.901" style="s2">MOM.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.201" end="00:15:50.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ISABELLA, WHY IS EVERYONE HERE? I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.101" end="00:15:50.901" style="s2">been looking everywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.901" end="00:16:00.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on? Where are you taking</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.701" end="00:16:00.101" style="s2">Bianca?</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.601" end="00:16:04.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie, help me. I don&#39;t want to go to</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.601" end="00:16:06.201" style="s2">Sister Mary.</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.601" end="00:16:07.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She crossed a line.</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.201" end="00:16:08.501" style="s2">Edmund shipping [music] her off to</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.201" end="00:16:10.301" style="s2">Sister Mary&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.501" end="00:16:12.901" style="s2">She&#39;s six.</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.301" end="00:16:16.401" style="s2">Kids mess up. You teach them.</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.901" end="00:16:16.401" style="s2">You don&#39;t nuke their life over it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.501" end="00:16:19.201" style="s2">Margaret&#39;s always spoiled [music] Bianca</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.001" end="00:16:23.002" style="s2">rotted.</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.201" end="00:16:23.002" style="s2">Next her, I&#39;m the evil birth mom.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.902" end="00:16:26.702" style="s2">Edmund,</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.102" end="00:16:29.702" style="s2">Bianca [music] still little.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.702" end="00:16:29.702" style="s2">Give her one more chance.</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.802" end="00:16:33.302" style="s2">You promise [music] no more bullying</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.602" end="00:16:36.102" style="s2">Avie.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.302" end="00:16:38.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I messed up. Swear I&#39;ll never bully</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.102" end="00:16:39.802" style="s2">Avie again.</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.402" end="00:16:41.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s Avie?</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.802" end="00:16:45.502" style="s2">She&#39;s a kid [music] I just took in.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.602" end="00:16:45.502" style="s2">Badly hurt. Still hasn&#39;t woken up.</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.102" end="00:16:48.902" style="s2">That face.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.602" end="00:16:52.502" style="s2">Why does she look so much like that</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.902" end="00:16:55.302" style="s2">little [ __ ] Whole face is wrapped up.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.502" end="00:16:55.302" style="s2">Is it really her?</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.202" end="00:17:01.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I swear I messed up. Please forgive</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.002" end="00:17:03.802" style="s2">me. Just one more chance.</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.502" end="00:17:07.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last warning. Room.</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.802" end="00:17:07.202" style="s2">Don&#39;t step out unless I say so.</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.902" end="00:17:10.981" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.102" end="00:17:13.001" style="s2">I&#39;ll think about it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.981" end="00:17:13.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.602" end="00:17:16.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca just got a new sister out of</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.202" end="00:17:18.502" style="s2">nowhere.</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.502" end="00:17:20.102" style="s2">Panicked. Thought you&#39;d love her less.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.502" end="00:17:23.102" style="s2">That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.102" end="00:17:23.102" style="s2">I&#39;ll take her to her room.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.902" end="00:17:33.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie, ever since Avie showed up,</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.102" end="00:17:36.302" style="s2">nobody loves me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.402" end="00:17:38.302" style="s2">It&#39;s all her now.</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.302" end="00:17:40.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way, sweetheart. [music] That girl&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.302" end="00:17:43.802" style="s2">got him fooled.</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.102" end="00:17:43.802" style="s2">Auntie&#39;s here. [snorts] I got you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.902" end="00:17:49.002" style="s2">Tell auntie</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.402" end="00:17:50.282" style="s2">when did Avie get here?</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.002" end="00:17:50.902" style="s2">Where did they find her?</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.282" end="00:17:52.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.902" end="00:17:54.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Few days ago.</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.502" end="00:17:55.522" style="s2">Mom and Arthur went out, came back with</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.702" end="00:17:56.902" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.522" end="00:17:58.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.902" end="00:17:59.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Few days ago.</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.402" end="00:18:02.702" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.702" end="00:18:02.702" style="s2">Could it really be her?</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.602" end="00:18:11.602" style="s2">Poor baby. [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.302" end="00:18:11.602" style="s2">Just stay in your room. Lay low for now.</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.502" end="00:18:25.903" style="s2">Let&#39;s see you really are.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.103" end="00:18:36.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Margaret.</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.103" end="00:18:40.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.303" end="00:18:41.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your servant just came. Your man is on</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.003" end="00:18:43.303" style="s2">fire.</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.103" end="00:18:44.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On fire? Every time I step foot in this</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.303" end="00:18:47.403" style="s2">place, something goes wrong. Carriage is</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.903" end="00:18:47.403" style="s2">ready. Go.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.003" end="00:18:55.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was this close.</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.703" end="00:18:55.203" style="s2">When I&#39;m back, I&#39;ll find out who she is.</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.503" end="00:19:00.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca, you&#39;re done with lockdown.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.713" end="00:19:01.703" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.403" end="00:19:04.903" style="s2">Come here.</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.703" end="00:19:07.103" style="s2">You still owe Avie an apology.</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.903" end="00:19:08.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie, I&#39;m sorry. I shouldn&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.103" end="00:19:09.903" style="s2">bullied you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.803" end="00:19:12.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.903" end="00:19:12.603" style="s2">I forgive you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.803" end="00:19:16.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, I messed up.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.803" end="00:19:19.603" style="s2">Let me take Avie out, [music] buy her</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.503" end="00:19:19.603" style="s2">something to make it up.</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.703" end="00:19:22.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, go on.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.103" end="00:19:25.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll come, [music] too. Grab mother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.503" end="00:19:25.403" style="s2">jewelry while I&#39;m at it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.103" end="00:19:36.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This dress would look lovely on you. Go</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.003" end="00:19:39.303" style="s2">try it on.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.503" end="00:19:39.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Bianca.</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.703" end="00:19:45.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother&#39;s jewelry should be ready. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.203" end="00:19:47.703" style="s2">grab it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.903" end="00:19:50.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie&#39;s trying on a dress. I&#39;m with her.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.703" end="00:19:50.203" style="s2">Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.803" end="00:19:56.703" style="s2">Arthur&#39;s grabbing stuff. Let&#39;s wait over</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.503" end="00:19:56.703" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.703" end="00:20:06.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no, I think I lost something. Going</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.503" end="00:20:08.803" style="s2">to go find it. Wait here.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.403" end="00:20:08.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.603" end="00:20:16.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca?</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.303" end="00:20:25.905" style="s2">Did I get left behind again?</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.005" end="00:20:30.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s Avie?</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.905" end="00:20:35.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I turned around for two [music] seconds</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.705" end="00:20:38.005" style="s2">to look at some jewelry and she was just</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.605" end="00:20:38.005" style="s2">gone.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.105" end="00:20:43.305" style="s2">I think she went east. Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.805" end="00:20:43.305" style="s2">Hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.805" end="00:20:58.605" style="s2">I should go back.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.205" end="00:21:10.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Woah, horse is spooked. Move. Get out OF</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.905" end="00:21:10.305" style="s2">THE WAY.</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.905" end="00:21:20.705" style="s2">SOMEBODY stop this thing.</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.705" end="00:21:27.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, horse. Please, stop.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.705" end="00:21:47.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scram.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.905" end="00:21:51.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie,</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.905" end="00:21:53.305" style="s2">are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.305" end="00:21:56.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Arthur, she she passed out. Arthur, help</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.305" end="00:21:56.305" style="s2">the princess. Hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.305" end="00:22:06.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get her to the palace, now.</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.305" end="00:22:16.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetheart, how are you feeling?</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.005" end="00:22:17.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m okay, mother.</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.405" end="00:22:19.505" style="s2">How did I get back?</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.905" end="00:22:22.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guards say a duke&#39;s girl saved [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.505" end="00:22:24.106" style="s2">you, brought you home.</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.105" end="00:22:26.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Invite her over. I want to thank her</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.106" end="00:22:28.506" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.006" end="00:22:28.506" style="s2">Send for her.</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.606" end="00:22:34.306" style="s2">Her Majesty requests the young [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.806" end="00:22:34.306" style="s2">lady who rescued the princess.</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.906" end="00:22:39.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was me. I&#39;m the one who saved her.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.006" end="00:22:48.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve got two girls in the house. Which</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.706" end="00:22:49.206" style="s2">one does Her Majesty mean?</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.206" end="00:22:51.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.206" end="00:22:53.506" style="s2">No idea, my lady.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.606" end="00:22:55.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then send both. Princess can sort it</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.506" end="00:22:57.906" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.306" end="00:22:57.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my lady.</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.006" end="00:23:05.206" style="s2">That hideous birthmark, you&#39;re going to</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.406" end="00:23:08.106" style="s2">show that to the queen and princess? You</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.206" end="00:23:08.106" style="s2">want to embarrass us?</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.506" end="00:23:13.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca, let her go. Don&#39;t you dare say</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.906" end="00:23:13.306" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.806" end="00:23:17.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you think they&#39;ll think it&#39;s gross?</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.706" end="00:23:23.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re worried, we&#39;ll cover it, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.006" end="00:23:31.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cover the birthmark all you want. Can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.206" end="00:23:33.006" style="s2">hide her trashy roots. She&#39;s going to</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.906" end="00:23:34.606" style="s2">humiliate us.</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.006" end="00:23:38.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough, Bianca.</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.606" end="00:23:38.306" style="s2">One more word and you stay home.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.906" end="00:23:53.806" style="s2">So what really happened that day?</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.506" end="00:23:56.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The carriage was carrying toward the</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.806" end="00:23:59.106" style="s2">wall. I stopped it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.006" end="00:23:59.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saved you, princess.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.606" end="00:24:06.506" style="s2">And you?</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.706" end="00:24:07.606" style="s2">What did you see?</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.506" end="00:24:11.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The horse was running really [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.606" end="00:24:13.906" style="s2">fast. I talked him down.</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.206" end="00:24:17.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, listen to yourself. You, you</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.906" end="00:24:17.306" style="s2">can&#39;t even climb onto a horse.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.701" end="00:24:21.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.506" end="00:24:24.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You passed out inside.</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.306" end="00:24:24.706" style="s2">I climbed in and helped you out.</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.107" end="00:24:34.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But neither girl has that crescent mark.</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.908" end="00:24:38.507" style="s2">Did I remember it wrong? Tomorrow, both</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.908" end="00:24:39.807" style="s2">of you etiquette training with me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.507" end="00:24:40.207" style="s2">Girls won&#39;t defend the princess, will</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.807" end="00:24:41.908" style="s2">they?</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.207" end="00:24:42.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. Our daughter&#39;s with the princess.</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.908" end="00:24:44.908" style="s2">That&#39;s a win.</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.807" end="00:24:46.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady, princess wants us for etiquette</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.908" end="00:24:48.307" style="s2">lessons.</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.307" end="00:24:48.908" style="s2">Why does she get to come? That was my</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.307" end="00:24:50.408" style="s2">big break.</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.908" end="00:24:53.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca, enough.</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.408" end="00:24:53.707" style="s2">You both better appreciate this.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.107" end="00:25:01.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sure you want both?</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.607" end="00:25:04.707" style="s2">Queen&#39;s only giving the title to one.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.408" end="00:25:04.707" style="s2">I need to see who they really are.</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.307" end="00:25:24.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ow! That&#39;s hot. Hot.</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.408" end="00:25:27.207" style="s2">HA! SHE DID IT ON PURPOSE.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.107" end="00:25:28.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I DIDN&#39;T. HONEST.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.207" end="00:25:32.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All the other stuff too. She&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.507" end="00:25:32.507" style="s2">disrupting the whole lesson. Punish her.</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.408" end="00:25:38.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Disrupting the lesson? That deserves a</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.207" end="00:25:39.307" style="s2">punishment. Bianca, extra practice now.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.607" end="00:25:42.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why me?</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.307" end="00:25:42.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw everything. All of it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.007" end="00:25:46.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Princess, I can&#39;t walk anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.507" end="00:25:49.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you bullying your little sister?</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.107" end="00:25:55.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was just</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.408" end="00:25:55.207" style="s2">right there. I mixed it up. That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.807" end="00:26:03.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you really save me that day?</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.908" end="00:26:03.408" style="s2">Whoever saved me wouldn&#39;t act like you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.607" end="00:26:07.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course it was me. Princess, come on.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.607" end="00:26:08.908" style="s2">You believe me, right?</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.307" end="00:26:12.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.908" end="00:26:12.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll pay for this, AV.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.807" end="00:26:16.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca, time for class.</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.307" end="00:26:20.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s Bianca?</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.507" end="00:26:23.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No idea, miss. Want me to look for her?</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.607" end="00:26:23.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please.</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.507" end="00:26:30.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, coachman says she already left.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.209" end="00:26:36.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry I&#39;m late.</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.009" end="00:26:36.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We already finished the lesson. Why are</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.209" end="00:26:38.109" style="s2">you late?</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.609" end="00:26:39.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was waiting for Bianca. She said we&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.109" end="00:26:41.009" style="s2">leave together. I&#39;ve been here forever.</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.509" end="00:26:42.009" style="s2">Don&#39;t pin your lateness on me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.009" end="00:26:44.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But yesterday you said</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.009" end="00:26:46.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me. Whose story am I buying?</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.709" end="00:26:47.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her finish.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.209" end="00:26:49.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was late. Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.809" end="00:26:51.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go fetch water from the garden. Next</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.309" end="00:26:51.609" style="s2">lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.609" end="00:27:14.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help!</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.409" end="00:27:17.709" style="s2">Somebody help me!</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.409" end="00:27:17.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quick! Pull them out!</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.758" end="00:27:24.778" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.209" end="00:27:33.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.709" end="00:27:33.309" style="s2">So it really was Ava who saved me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.409" end="00:27:37.209" style="s2">Baby, how are you feeling?</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.909" end="00:27:37.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.209" end="00:27:38.809" style="s2">I&#39;m okay.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.824" end="00:27:39.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.809" end="00:27:41.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.709" end="00:27:42.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw the whole thing in the garden.</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.009" end="00:27:43.409" style="s2">Bianca pushed you in.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.009" end="00:27:44.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Princess, you got to be mistaken. I was</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.409" end="00:27:46.209" style="s2">trying to pull her up.</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.409" end="00:27:48.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Ava&#39;s the one who saved me that day.</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.209" end="00:27:49.809" style="s2">I&#39;d know that mark anywhere. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.509" end="00:27:51.109" style="s2">From the crown</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.809" end="00:27:54.709" style="s2">as a thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.109" end="00:27:57.609" style="s2">When you come of age, you get a title.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.709" end="00:27:57.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank [music] you, Princess.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.409" end="00:28:01.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As for you, Bianca,</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.909" end="00:28:03.409" style="s2">you&#39;re dead.</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.909" end="00:28:05.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am sorry, Princess. Won&#39;t happen</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.409" end="00:28:05.709" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.909" end="00:28:10.909" style="s2">Princess,</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.309" end="00:28:14.509" style="s2">can you give her another chance?</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.909" end="00:28:14.509" style="s2">The Duchess is already heartbroken.</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.709" end="00:28:19.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For Ava&#39;s sake, I&#39;ll go easy on you</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.129" end="00:28:20.709" style="s2">[music] this time. Apologize to her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.209" end="00:28:22.109" style="s2">You&#39;re grounded. No leaving your room</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.709" end="00:28:22.709" style="s2">without permission.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.109" end="00:28:25.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.709" end="00:28:27.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apologize. [music] Now.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.909" end="00:28:29.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ava, I&#39;m sorry. Shouldn&#39;t have taken</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.709" end="00:28:32.909" style="s2">credit.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.409" end="00:28:32.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could Bianca do something like this?</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.409" end="00:28:39.210" style="s2">Who asked you to stick up for me? Fake.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.510" end="00:28:51.910" style="s2">Get this letter to my aunt. Rings yours.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.010" end="00:28:51.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, dinner&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.810" end="00:28:57.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie, [music] feeling better?</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.910" end="00:28:59.044" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie, once you&#39;re all healed, we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.610" end="00:28:59.410" style="s2">throwing a huge welcome banquet for you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.044" end="00:29:00.510" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.410" end="00:29:02.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A welcome banquet?</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.510" end="00:29:04.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. Everyone&#39;s going to know you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.010" end="00:29:05.010" style="s2">our daughter, a Lambert. You never got</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.010" end="00:29:08.810" style="s2">to worry about being left behind [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.010" end="00:29:08.810" style="s2">again. This is your home forever.</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.010" end="00:29:17.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie, punishing Bianca over some stray</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.510" end="00:29:19.110" style="s2">they picked up?</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.110" end="00:29:21.810" style="s2">You think you can mess with my daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.110" end="00:29:21.810" style="s2">Just you wait.</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.910" end="00:29:31.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you think you&#39;re doing?</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.910" end="00:29:34.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Muddy shoes, ma&#39;am. This way. Wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.810" end="00:29:34.810" style="s2">want to mess up the carpet.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.610" end="00:29:41.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Heard Avie [music] was under the</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.510" end="00:29:43.910" style="s2">weather. Brought some gifts.</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.810" end="00:29:49.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, Lady Margaret&#39;s here to see you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.910" end="00:29:49.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lady Margaret? Oh, auntie. Let her in.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.610" end="00:30:04.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just came to see our little</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.580" end="00:30:04.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.010" end="00:30:12.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.410" end="00:30:12.710" style="s2">What the hell are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.510" end="00:30:26.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get him out. We need to talk.</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.710" end="00:30:28.710" style="s2">What, you don&#39;t want to let him go? Then</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.310" end="00:30:30.010" style="s2">call me mommy right here in front of</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.710" end="00:30:31.710" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.010" end="00:30:33.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good girl. Keep your mouth shut.</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.710" end="00:30:34.910" style="s2">Nobody&#39;s going to know.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.510" end="00:30:36.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or what, you think you&#39;re some fancy</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.910" end="00:30:39.512" style="s2">duke&#39;s kid now, too good for your own</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.712" end="00:30:40.712" style="s2">mom, then get them out.</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.512" end="00:30:43.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You guys,</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.712" end="00:30:43.412" style="s2">can you leave?</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.112" end="00:30:48.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at this room.</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.812" end="00:30:52.112" style="s2">These clothes.</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.712" end="00:30:54.212" style="s2">Barely got a full meal before, and now</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.112" end="00:30:55.512" style="s2">Daddy&#39;s little princess.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.212" end="00:30:56.712" style="s2">But you really think they&#39;ll keep being</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.512" end="00:30:59.112" style="s2">nice to you?</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.712" end="00:31:00.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She won&#39;t leave me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.112" end="00:31:02.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sorcerer [music] warned us. That</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.412" end="00:31:04.712" style="s2">mark on your head, bad omen. They find</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.712" end="00:31:05.712" style="s2">out, the whole house, the princess, they</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.712" end="00:31:06.812" style="s2">all turn on you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.712" end="00:31:08.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not true.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.812" end="00:31:10.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who wants a walking curse?</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.812" end="00:31:11.312" style="s2">Think about it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.112" end="00:31:13.912" style="s2">Any good thing ever happened to you</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.312" end="00:31:15.812" style="s2">living with me?</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.912" end="00:31:18.712" style="s2">You finally got a new home. Really want</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.812" end="00:31:18.712" style="s2">to get dumped again?</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.112" end="00:31:25.912" style="s2">I can keep your secret.</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.412" end="00:31:25.912" style="s2">But you got to do two things for me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.712" end="00:31:34.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be good, I promise. I won&#39;t eat</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.212" end="00:31:36.312" style="s2">ever again.</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.212" end="00:31:39.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First, [music] go beg them to let Bianca</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.312" end="00:31:41.312" style="s2">out and nobody hears about us ever.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.312" end="00:31:43.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca did something wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.312" end="00:31:45.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca&#39;s the real lady of this house.</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.212" end="00:31:46.512" style="s2">You say one word, everyone drops [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.012" end="00:31:47.912" style="s2">you. Got it?</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.512" end="00:31:51.212" style="s2">I open my mouth about who you really</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.912" end="00:31:52.512" style="s2">are, nobody&#39;s going to protect you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.212" end="00:31:55.112" style="s2">There we go. Remember, [music] you</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.512" end="00:31:55.112" style="s2">agreed to this.</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.067" end="00:32:07.087" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.912" end="00:32:10.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone,</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.912" end="00:32:11.712" style="s2">by the authority of Duke Lambert,</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.962" end="00:32:13.912" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.712" end="00:32:17.212" style="s2">I present Avy, daughter of Edmund and</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.912" end="00:32:20.812" style="s2">Isabella, Avy Lambert.</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.212" end="00:32:20.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avy, call me mom.</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.512" end="00:32:25.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.407" end="00:32:25.912" style="s2">[music] Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.012" end="00:32:34.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That should have been me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.577" end="00:32:34.597" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.712" end="00:32:40.513" style="s2">Avy, this pony&#39;s yours. You calmed that</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.312" end="00:32:42.313" style="s2">spooked horse [music] and saved me that</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.513" end="00:32:45.713" style="s2">day. Ever since you came into my life,</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.313" end="00:32:45.713" style="s2">my health&#39;s gotten so much better.</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.332" end="00:32:48.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.813" end="00:33:05.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GRAB IT. SOMEBODY GRAB IT.</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.613" end="00:33:05.213" style="s2">IT&#39;S GONE MAD. KEEP IT AWAY FROM ME.</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.842" end="00:33:16.913" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.513" end="00:33:16.913" style="s2">YOU SEE?</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.513" end="00:33:22.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT&#39;S WRONG WITH IT?</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.013" end="00:33:22.013" style="s2">It&#39;s never like this.</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.713" end="00:33:28.813" style="s2">AV can calm a [music] spooked horse,</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.113" end="00:33:30.213" style="s2">right? So what about this cat?</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.813" end="00:33:31.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it going to work?</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.213" end="00:33:34.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doubt it. [music] Last time was probably</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.613" end="00:33:34.313" style="s2">just luck.</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.768" end="00:33:38.788" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.043" end="00:33:43.913" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.913" end="00:33:43.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; AV, you don&#39;t have to.</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.213" end="00:33:51.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy, [snorts] kitty. Come on. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.713" end="00:33:51.713" style="s2">Settle down, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.813" end="00:33:56.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did it scratch you?</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.713" end="00:34:00.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, it&#39;s not scared anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.713" end="00:34:00.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; AV, you saved me again.</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.413" end="00:34:03.313" style="s2">If it weren&#39;t for AV, more people would</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.013" end="00:34:05.413" style="s2">have gotten hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.313" end="00:34:08.208" style="s2">She&#39;s our little lucky charm.</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.413" end="00:34:08.863" style="s2">Sweetheart, you did so good.</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.208" end="00:34:09.913" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.863" end="00:34:12.313" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.913" end="00:34:13.413" style="s2">No way. That little brat actually pulled</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.313" end="00:34:16.113" style="s2">it off.</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.413" end="00:34:17.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie, she&#39;s a monster.</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.113" end="00:34:19.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A monster?</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.713" end="00:34:22.113" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.213" end="00:34:22.113" style="s2">A monster.</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.813" end="00:34:27.713" style="s2">Don&#39;t be in such a hurry to show me the</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.313" end="00:34:27.713" style="s2">door.</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.813" end="00:34:31.313" style="s2">You helped me six years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.913" end="00:34:32.813" style="s2">Help me again,</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.313" end="00:34:34.913" style="s2">just like back then.</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.813" end="00:34:34.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.913" end="00:34:40.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That kid again?</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.313" end="00:34:47.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want her</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.714" end="00:34:47.714" style="s2">out of that house.</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.914" end="00:34:54.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.414" end="00:34:56.014" style="s2">that kids got luck on her side. The more</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.714" end="00:34:57.714" style="s2">[music] you go after her, the worse it</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.014" end="00:35:00.614" style="s2">bounces back on you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.714" end="00:35:00.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t buy it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.884" end="00:35:06.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.514" end="00:35:09.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep hurting her and you&#39;ll be the one</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.414" end="00:35:09.614" style="s2">who ends up destroyed.</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.714" end="00:35:16.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care. I JUST WANT her dead.</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.314" end="00:35:21.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca?</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.114" end="00:35:22.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mum, I heard something awful about Avie</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.314" end="00:35:23.534" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.714" end="00:35:24.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What rumors?</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.534" end="00:35:26.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.014" end="00:35:27.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People are saying she&#39;s not normal, a</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.014" end="00:35:28.714" style="s2">monster.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.314" end="00:35:30.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who started these rumors?</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.714" end="00:35:31.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone&#39;s talking about it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.739" end="00:35:34.314" style="s2">[music] They say she&#39;ll bring bad luck</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.914" end="00:35:36.814" style="s2">to the whole family, even the kingdom.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.314" end="00:35:38.814" style="s2">She&#39;s a total jinx. Mum, what if the</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.814" end="00:35:41.614" style="s2">king hears this? What if he actually</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.814" end="00:35:41.614" style="s2">believes it?</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.614" end="00:35:46.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have someone look into it now.</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.494" end="00:35:46.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.414" end="00:35:53.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca, what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.414" end="00:35:54.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone out there is calling you a</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.614" end="00:35:56.514" style="s2">monster.</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.514" end="00:35:58.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;m not a monster.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.514" end="00:36:00.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not a monster? Then what are you? Dead</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.714" end="00:36:02.414" style="s2">flowers bloom for you, frightened horses</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.514" end="00:36:04.514" style="s2">stop, wild cats settle people do that?</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.414" end="00:36:04.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not it. Mum said I&#39;m a lucky</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.514" end="00:36:07.414" style="s2">star.</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.814" end="00:36:09.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. She&#39;s my mum. Who told you you</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.414" end="00:36:11.114" style="s2">could call her that? You&#39;re a monster, a</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.314" end="00:36:12.814" style="s2">jinx. You&#39;ll bring disaster on this</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.114" end="00:36:14.914" style="s2">whole family. Everyone says so. You</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.814" end="00:36:16.614" style="s2">don&#39;t belong here. Get out of my house.</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.914" end="00:36:18.114" style="s2">Stop playing the victim. Nobody&#39;s going</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.614" end="00:36:21.514" style="s2">to believe you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.114" end="00:36:21.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not a monster.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.314" end="00:36:29.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By order of his majesty, the duke, the</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.914" end="00:36:30.514" style="s2">duchess, and Miss Avie Lambert, palace</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.014" end="00:36:31.514" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.514" end="00:36:34.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the rumors [music] made it to the</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.514" end="00:36:34.014" style="s2">palace.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.814" end="00:36:47.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Duke Lambert,</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.516" end="00:36:50.016" style="s2">word around the capital is your</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.916" end="00:36:51.116" style="s2">daughter&#39;s [music] a jinx. What do you</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.016" end="00:36:52.316" style="s2">say?</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.116" end="00:36:54.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty,</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.316" end="00:36:57.816" style="s2">Avie never hurts anyone. [music] These</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.316" end="00:36:57.816" style="s2">rumors are baseless slander.</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.516" end="00:37:05.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.916" end="00:37:08.016" style="s2">Avie&#39;s kind and well-behaved.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.116" end="00:37:08.016" style="s2">Please believe in her.</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.916" end="00:37:11.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t convicted her.</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.516" end="00:37:13.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father,</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.516" end="00:37:17.416" style="s2">Avie&#39;s not a monster. She saved me</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.816" end="00:37:17.416" style="s2">twice. I&#39;ll vouch for her.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.316" end="00:37:21.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eleanor,</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.216" end="00:37:23.516" style="s2">I know you&#39;re fond of her, [music] but</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.916" end="00:37:24.716" style="s2">you can&#39;t ignore the doubts because of</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.516" end="00:37:27.816" style="s2">personal feelings.</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.716" end="00:37:31.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not speaking up because I like her.</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.816" end="00:37:33.880" style="s2">I know what kind of person she is.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.816" end="00:37:35.416" style="s2">My dear, we can&#39;t convict a child on</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.880" end="00:37:37.816" style="s2">[music] rumors before the truth is</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.416" end="00:37:37.816" style="s2">clear.</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.216" end="00:37:42.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.516" end="00:37:45.716" style="s2">3 days.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.816" end="00:37:45.716" style="s2">Find out the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.616" end="00:37:53.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can take Avie to the kingdom&#39;s top</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.216" end="00:37:55.916" style="s2">church. Have the archbishop examine her</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.416" end="00:37:55.916" style="s2">himself.</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.316" end="00:38:01.616" style="s2">All right.</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.716" end="00:38:05.716" style="s2">We&#39;ll go to church.</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.616" end="00:38:05.716" style="s2">Don&#39;t be scared, Avie. Mom&#39;s right here.</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.596" end="00:38:12.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.016" end="00:38:14.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.116" end="00:38:14.916" style="s2">I trust you, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.316" end="00:38:25.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady, the Lamberts are taking Avie to</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.416" end="00:38:25.016" style="s2">the church.</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.916" end="00:38:30.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get Morgan, now.</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.016" end="00:38:30.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my lady.</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.176" end="00:38:34.196" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.216" end="00:38:48.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie,</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.586" end="00:38:51.917" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.316" end="00:38:51.917" style="s2">let&#39;s see how you get out of this one.</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.317" end="00:39:00.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father, I want to go with AV.</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.317" end="00:39:00.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay here. Wait for news.</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.117" end="00:39:09.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All set?</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.062" end="00:39:18.082" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.917" end="00:39:34.717" style="s2">Don&#39;t be scared. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.217" end="00:39:34.717" style="s2">I&#39;m right here.</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.317" end="00:39:38.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Begin the examination.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.217" end="00:39:43.717" style="s2">Everyone,</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.607" end="00:39:47.717" style="s2">[music] my recent observations turned up</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.717" end="00:39:47.717" style="s2">a rare and ominous sign.</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.017" end="00:39:58.717" style="s2">And it matches the crescent mark on this</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.672" end="00:40:03.117" style="s2">[music] child&#39;s forehead. Not a birth</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.717" end="00:40:03.117" style="s2">mark, a disaster star&#39;s arrival.</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.017" end="00:40:08.217" style="s2">Her freak abilities, warnings of what&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.317" end="00:40:11.617" style="s2">coming. Do nothing [music] and this</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.217" end="00:40:11.617" style="s2">kingdom pays the price.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.317" end="00:40:20.117" style="s2">I saw the same sign. My calculations</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.322" end="00:40:20.117" style="s2">[music] match his exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.717" end="00:40:29.117" style="s2">If they&#39;re right, she could doom the</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.417" end="00:40:29.117" style="s2">whole kingdom.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.617" end="00:40:34.217" style="s2">A disaster star? THEN DRIVE HER OUT.</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.717" end="00:40:40.717" style="s2">Kicking her out, that&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.717" end="00:40:40.717" style="s2">No. We got to end this for good.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.817" end="00:40:52.318" style="s2">By order of His Majesty,</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.618" end="00:40:55.318" style="s2">The Duke, the Duchess, and Miss Ava</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.318" end="00:40:56.318" style="s2">Lambert. Palace, right now.</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.318" end="00:40:58.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the room has made it to the [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.318" end="00:40:58.918" style="s2">palace.</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.918" end="00:41:23.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Duke Lambert,</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.618" end="00:41:26.518" style="s2">word around the capital is your</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.718" end="00:41:28.918" style="s2">daughter&#39;s a jinx. What do you say?</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.518" end="00:41:32.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, Ava&#39;s never hurt anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.918" end="00:41:32.418" style="s2">These rumors are baseless slander.</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.118" end="00:41:37.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, [music] Ava&#39;s kind and</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.318" end="00:41:40.818" style="s2">well-behaved.</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.918" end="00:41:40.818" style="s2">Please believe in her.</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.618" end="00:41:44.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t convicted her.</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.118" end="00:41:48.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, am I really going to bring disaster</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.218" end="00:41:50.818" style="s2">to everyone?</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.018" end="00:41:53.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not. Please use real</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.818" end="00:41:56.918" style="s2">astrology. Find the truth. You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.218" end="00:41:56.918" style="s2">convict Ava on a few predictions.</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.218" end="00:42:07.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The stars foretell [music] fortune and</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.818" end="00:42:09.518" style="s2">hope. Miss Ava is no jinx. She&#39;s luck</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.418" end="00:42:11.018" style="s2">blessed. How did it turn out like this?</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.518" end="00:42:13.418" style="s2">You think they got bribed to frame</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.018" end="00:42:13.418" style="s2">someone?</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.818" end="00:42:19.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do your predictions contradict the</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.718" end="00:42:20.718" style="s2">What you hiding?</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.118" end="00:42:23.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, we we we were just reading</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.718" end="00:42:23.818" style="s2">the [music] stars, nothing more.</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.918" end="00:42:31.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then explain these [music] markings. Why</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.718" end="00:42:31.718" style="s2">don&#39;t they match the sky you described?</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.618" end="00:42:43.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guards, grab those [music] two and that</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.718" end="00:42:43.418" style="s2">man over there.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.920" end="00:42:59.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.220" end="00:43:02.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sneaking around like that. Take him in.</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.120" end="00:43:02.120" style="s2">We&#39;ll get [music] answers out of him.</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.920" end="00:43:07.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Margaret, [music] Morgan won&#39;t rat</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.420" end="00:43:08.620" style="s2">us out, will he? Are we going to be in</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.220" end="00:43:10.720" style="s2">trouble?</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.620" end="00:43:13.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. I left nothing behind. They got</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.720" end="00:43:13.220" style="s2">no proof.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.920" end="00:43:18.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady, your grace, Morgan confessed.</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.320" end="00:43:20.020" style="s2">Lady Margaret was behind it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.420" end="00:43:21.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Margaret?</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.020" end="00:43:23.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She went this far. She&#39;s got something</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.220" end="00:43:23.820" style="s2">else planned.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.220" end="00:43:27.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evie, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.020" end="00:43:31.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing, mum.</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.820" end="00:43:31.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If anything&#39;s bothering you, tell us.</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.420" end="00:43:41.820" style="s2">Don&#39;t be scared. Auntie won&#39;t let anyone</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.320" end="00:43:41.820" style="s2">hurt you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.320" end="00:43:54.520" style="s2">Margaret,</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.220" end="00:43:57.720" style="s2">you better start explaining</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.520" end="00:43:57.720" style="s2">what the hell is going on.</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.610" end="00:44:07.520" style="s2">[snorts] Why&#39;d you tell Morgan to spread</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.920" end="00:44:08.720" style="s2">those rumors about Evie?</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.520" end="00:44:10.220" style="s2">Morgan?</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.720" end="00:44:11.020" style="s2">Rumors? I have no idea what you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.220" end="00:44:12.420" style="s2">talking about.</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.020" end="00:44:14.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cut the act.</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.420" end="00:44:16.520" style="s2">Morgan confessed everything.</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.320" end="00:44:19.620" style="s2">What did Evie ever do to you? Why go</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.520" end="00:44:19.620" style="s2">this far to destroy her?</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.120" end="00:44:23.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca,</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.220" end="00:44:26.520" style="s2">do you know about this too?</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.920" end="00:44:26.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.920" end="00:44:31.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ever since Evie came back, she gets</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.520" end="00:44:34.020" style="s2">everything. When have you ever actually</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.820" end="00:44:36.320" style="s2">cared about Bianca? Bianca&#39;s the one who</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.020" end="00:44:38.020" style="s2">deserves to be loved. Evie showed up and</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.320" end="00:44:39.220" style="s2">took everything from her. [music] Evie</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.020" end="00:44:41.120" style="s2">suffered.</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.220" end="00:44:43.020" style="s2">We were making it up to her. We never</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.120" end="00:44:45.620" style="s2">meant to neglect Bianca. You know damn</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.020" end="00:44:47.820" style="s2">well if she&#39;s been neglected.</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.620" end="00:44:49.320" style="s2">Because Bianca messed up. Why do you</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.820" end="00:44:51.620" style="s2">spoil her no matter what but always</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.320" end="00:44:53.421" style="s2">treat Evie with hostility?</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.620" end="00:44:56.921" style="s2">Bianca&#39;s the child I raised. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.421" end="00:44:56.921" style="s2">Avie? She&#39;s nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.321" end="00:45:00.521" style="s2">Then from now on, [music] I don&#39;t have a</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.621" end="00:45:02.021" style="s2">sister.</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.521" end="00:45:03.871" style="s2">Leave this estate. I never want to see</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.021" end="00:45:05.921" style="s2">you again.</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.871" end="00:45:09.521" style="s2">[snorts] Fine, I&#39;m gone. If it weren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.921" end="00:45:09.521" style="s2">for Bianca, I&#39;d never set foot here.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.621" end="00:45:16.121" style="s2">You better treat Bianca right or you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.521" end="00:45:16.121" style="s2">answer me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.421" end="00:45:22.021" style="s2">She&#39;s way too into Bianca. Something&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.221" end="00:45:22.021" style="s2">definitely wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.221" end="00:45:27.451" style="s2">Don&#39;t be scared.</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.521" end="00:45:30.421" style="s2">You and Avie are both my children.</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.451" end="00:45:30.421" style="s2">[music] I love you the same.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.921" end="00:45:36.621" style="s2">Avie, it&#39;s all cleared up. You don&#39;t got</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.721" end="00:45:38.421" style="s2">to worry anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.621" end="00:45:41.621" style="s2">Margaret&#39;s your aunt, right? Why did she</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.421" end="00:45:43.321" style="s2">have people spread those rumors?</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.621" end="00:45:45.421" style="s2">Bianca&#39;s the real lady of this house.</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.321" end="00:45:47.321" style="s2">You say one word, everyone drops you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.421" end="00:45:49.021" style="s2">Got it? I open my mouth about who you</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.321" end="00:45:50.521" style="s2">really are, nobody&#39;s going to protect</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.021" end="00:45:54.621" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.521" end="00:45:54.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe she just doesn&#39;t like me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.921" end="00:46:02.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie,</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.221" end="00:46:02.321" style="s2">has Aunt Margaret talked to you alone?</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.221" end="00:46:09.821" style="s2">Avie,</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.221" end="00:46:12.821" style="s2">if something&#39;s going on, you tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.821" end="00:46:12.821" style="s2">No secrets, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.721" end="00:46:24.121" style="s2">That [music] damn Morgan</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.321" end="00:46:25.521" style="s2">betrayed me. He&#39;s going to pay.</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.121" end="00:46:28.121" style="s2">Now what?</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.521" end="00:46:30.921" style="s2">I can&#39;t go back to that estate.</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.121" end="00:46:34.121" style="s2">What about Bianca?</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.921" end="00:46:37.521" style="s2">That little [ __ ] Avie.</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.121" end="00:46:37.521" style="s2">I&#39;ll find a way to get rid of her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.921" end="00:46:41.521" style="s2">My lady, time to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.921" end="00:46:52.821" style="s2">All this mess, you can&#39;t clean it up?</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.921" end="00:46:55.521" style="s2">Just like that little [ __ ] So</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.821" end="00:46:55.521" style="s2">annoying.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.622" end="00:47:06.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Useless.</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.323" end="00:47:18.523" style="s2">Used to feed that little brat plenty.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.622" end="00:47:21.922" style="s2">Now she&#39;s living a good life.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.523" end="00:47:21.922" style="s2">Wonder if she even remembers you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.622" end="00:47:32.823" style="s2">Time to go. The driver will pick you up.</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.122" end="00:47:34.523" style="s2">Don&#39;t wander off. Got it?</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.823" end="00:47:37.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, mum.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.523" end="00:47:37.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good girl. Off you go.</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.223" end="00:47:49.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady,</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.723" end="00:47:50.122" style="s2">the carriage got stuck in the mud ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.223" end="00:47:50.622" style="s2">Could you maybe walk a few steps</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.122" end="00:47:52.422" style="s2">forward?</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.622" end="00:47:53.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you? No, mum said to wait right</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.422" end="00:47:56.223" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.723" end="00:47:59.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, my lady, save my life. If you</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.223" end="00:48:00.823" style="s2">don&#39;t come, Lady Margaret will kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.723" end="00:48:02.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s you?</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.823" end="00:48:03.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, my lady, help me. Just go a</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.523" end="00:48:06.223" style="s2">little further. The lady wants to see</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.922" end="00:48:08.323" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.223" end="00:48:10.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do I do? Auntie&#39;s definitely up to</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.323" end="00:48:10.823" style="s2">no good. But if I don&#39;t go</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.023" end="00:48:13.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t wander off.</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.823" end="00:48:13.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.523" end="00:48:31.922" style="s2">Ava still isn&#39;t back.</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.523" end="00:48:34.622" style="s2">I waited at the palace gates. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.922" end="00:48:34.622" style="s2">She never came.</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.723" end="00:48:38.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She wouldn&#39;t wander off.</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.223" end="00:48:38.823" style="s2">Something&#39;s wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.122" end="00:48:42.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take her portrait. Search the route</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.523" end="00:48:44.922" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.122" end="00:48:44.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m coming, too.</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.523" end="00:48:59.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you seen this little girl?</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.823" end="00:48:59.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me. Have you seen this child?</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.823" end="00:49:03.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that Margaret&#39;s daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.724" end="00:49:06.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.724" end="00:49:09.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw this child at her manor. She</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.224" end="00:49:11.024" style="s2">called Lady Margaret mama back then.</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.624" end="00:49:13.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.024" end="00:49:13.924" style="s2">Margaret&#39;s Avie&#39;s mom.</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.824" end="00:49:19.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father, I&#39;ll go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.124" end="00:49:19.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take the guards. We&#39;re right behind you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.324" end="00:49:27.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s Avie?</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.124" end="00:49:32.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No sign of her.</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.324" end="00:49:32.124" style="s2">Margaret&#39;s gone too.</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.624" end="00:49:36.124" style="s2">We checked every room. No one&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.124" end="00:49:41.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re bringing Avie home.</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.324" end="00:49:44.224" style="s2">Track Margaret down. Send more men to</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.924" end="00:49:44.224" style="s2">Avie.</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.624" end="00:49:56.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lady,</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.924" end="00:49:59.924" style="s2">she&#39;s only a child.</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.824" end="00:49:59.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Growing a conscience now?</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.924" end="00:50:10.724" style="s2">Tell anyone what happened tonight</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.324" end="00:50:14.424" style="s2">and I&#39;ll kill you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.724" end="00:50:14.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t. Not a single word.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.524" end="00:50:22.824" style="s2">Your Grace, someone [music] slipped this</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.224" end="00:50:22.824" style="s2">under the door.</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.624" end="00:50:28.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does it say?</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.124" end="00:50:33.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie&#39;s been thrown [music] into the sea.</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.824" end="00:50:41.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take me there right now.</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.624" end="00:50:41.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get the horses.</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.510" end="00:50:44.530" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.424" end="00:50:53.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie,</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.324" end="00:50:54.955" style="s2">mommy&#39;s here to take you home.</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.924" end="00:50:57.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep looking. Don&#39;t miss a single</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.955" end="00:50:57.624" style="s2">[music] spot.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.824" end="00:51:05.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie,</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.924" end="00:51:08.225" style="s2">I found her. She&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.925" end="00:51:11.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie, look at mummy. Please.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.225" end="00:51:11.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get her home. Get the doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.325" end="00:51:16.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When will she wake up?</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.825" end="00:51:22.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s hurt really badly. I&#39;m afraid</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.925" end="00:51:23.125" style="s2">she may not make it through the night.</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.325" end="00:51:25.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.125" end="00:51:28.025" style="s2">Please check her again.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.725" end="00:51:31.325" style="s2">Avie.</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.025" end="00:51:32.225" style="s2">Mummy failed to keep you safe.</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.325" end="00:51:33.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mum,</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.225" end="00:51:36.825" style="s2">she moved.</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.825" end="00:51:39.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mummy, I&#39;m okay.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.825" end="00:51:39.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie, look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.325" end="00:51:50.325" style="s2">Is she going to be okay? She still needs</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.025" end="00:51:50.325" style="s2">to be watched closely.</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.925" end="00:51:57.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t leave me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.725" end="00:52:00.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never.</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.725" end="00:52:03.125" style="s2">Mummy&#39;s right here.</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.325" end="00:52:03.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy&#39;s staying too.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.225" end="00:52:06.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie,</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.325" end="00:52:09.325" style="s2">is something on your mind? You can tell</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.025" end="00:52:09.325" style="s2">me anything. Don&#39;t be scared.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.425" end="00:52:14.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mummy, Aunt Margaret left me in the</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.325" end="00:52:15.625" style="s2">Black Forest.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.225" end="00:52:17.486" style="s2">She&#39;s my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.625" end="00:52:18.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, sweetheart. Someone recognized</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.486" end="00:52:20.725" style="s2">[music] you while we were searching.</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.625" end="00:52:23.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She threw me into the sea too.</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.725" end="00:52:23.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You poor thing.</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.125" end="00:52:28.825" style="s2">Your Grace, we found Lady Margaret.</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.125" end="00:52:29.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring her in and go get my wife and the</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.825" end="00:52:32.025" style="s2">young lady.</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.525" end="00:52:32.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, your Grace.</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.325" end="00:52:41.825" style="s2">Why aren&#39;t you dead yet, you little</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.625" end="00:52:43.725" style="s2">[ __ ] [music]</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.825" end="00:52:45.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got some nerve yelling at her.</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.725" end="00:52:48.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s your own daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.025" end="00:52:49.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what? She was in my way.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.525" end="00:52:50.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re out of your mind. I never want to</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.725" end="00:52:51.425" style="s2">see you again. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.325" end="00:52:52.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie&#39;s a little [ __ ] She deserves to</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.425" end="00:52:53.725" style="s2">die. If it weren&#39;t for her, Bianca</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.425" end="00:52:54.925" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t be like this. Drag her out from</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.725" end="00:52:56.225" style="s2">Nobody associates with Margaret, and</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.925" end="00:52:57.725" style="s2">she&#39;s never setting foot in this estate</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.225" end="00:53:01.825" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.725" end="00:53:01.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me, Isabella. I&#39;m your sister.</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.425" end="00:53:07.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mum, please don&#39;t send Aunt Margaret</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.227" end="00:53:07.627" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.527" end="00:53:14.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you hear what she just called Evie?</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.227" end="00:53:16.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But Aunt Margaret&#39;s always been good to</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.027" end="00:53:19.127" style="s2">me. I just want to see her sometimes.</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.627" end="00:53:19.127" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.327" end="00:53:23.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know I was wrong. I&#39;ll never hurt Evie</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.227" end="00:53:26.327" style="s2">again. Just let me see Bianca. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.327" end="00:53:26.327" style="s2">agree with anything.</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.536" end="00:53:32.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.927" end="00:53:34.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can see her once every three months</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.927" end="00:53:36.027" style="s2">outside the estate only.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.427" end="00:53:38.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, mom. I&#39;ll do whatever you</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.027" end="00:53:38.427" style="s2">say.</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.707" end="00:53:40.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.827" end="00:53:44.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take her out.</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.227" end="00:53:52.627" style="s2">So cruel to her own daughter, but treats</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.327" end="00:53:52.627" style="s2">my daughter like a princess.</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.327" end="00:53:59.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait in the carriage. I want some time</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.827" end="00:54:01.727" style="s2">alone with Aunt Margaret.</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.427" end="00:54:03.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wore this dress last [music] time.</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.727" end="00:54:05.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom spends all her time with Evie. She</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.727" end="00:54:06.527" style="s2">doesn&#39;t even notice me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.127" end="00:54:08.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want to live like this forever?</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.527" end="00:54:09.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what am I supposed to do?</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.327" end="00:54:11.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once Evie&#39;s [music] gone, they&#39;ll love</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.927" end="00:54:12.727" style="s2">you again.</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.027" end="00:54:14.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re going to poison her?</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.727" end="00:54:16.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All you have to do is get me a maid&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.127" end="00:54:17.127" style="s2">uniform tonight. Get me inside. I&#39;ll do</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.527" end="00:54:18.427" style="s2">the rest.</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.127" end="00:54:18.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we get caught, they&#39;ll throw me out</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.427" end="00:54:20.127" style="s2">too. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.827" end="00:54:22.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then wait till they give her your room</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.127" end="00:54:22.527" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.127" end="00:54:26.727" style="s2">Wait by the side gate after dark.</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.327" end="00:54:31.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.527" end="00:54:39.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My maid. She went to pick up [music] my</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.127" end="00:54:39.827" style="s2">new clothes.</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.027" end="00:54:47.827" style="s2">I&#39;m going to [music] bed.</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.127" end="00:55:06.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s her room. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.827" end="00:55:06.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go back. Don&#39;t let anyone see you.</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.828" end="00:55:19.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.528" end="00:55:22.928" style="s2">You&#39;re nothing compared to my real</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.028" end="00:55:26.028" style="s2">daughter, Bianca. What did you just say?</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.928" end="00:55:26.028" style="s2">You What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.928" end="00:55:31.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Arthur.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.528" end="00:55:33.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard [music] everything. What&#39;s that</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.828" end="00:55:36.528" style="s2">supposed to mean?</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.728" end="00:55:38.228" style="s2">That&#39;s right. Bianca&#39;s my kid, and you,</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.528" end="00:55:40.328" style="s2">you little [ __ ] are Isabella&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.228" end="00:55:41.728" style="s2">daughter. All these years I abused you</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.328" end="00:55:44.228" style="s2">cuz YOU&#39;RE NOT MY KID.</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.728" end="00:55:45.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT&#39;S ENOUGH.</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.228" end="00:55:48.928" style="s2">BUT NONE OF THAT MATTERS NOW. We&#39;re all</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.828" end="00:55:48.928" style="s2">going TO HELL TOGETHER.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.728" end="00:55:53.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ARTHUR,</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.528" end="00:55:53.228" style="s2">IT&#39;S ON FIRE.</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.828" end="00:56:00.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no, fire. Miss Abby&#39;s room is on</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.928" end="00:56:01.828" style="s2">fire.</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.328" end="00:56:05.028" style="s2">ABBY, MY ABBY.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.828" end="00:56:05.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOVE. PUT OUT THE FIRE.</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.228" end="00:56:10.528" style="s2">ISABELLA, calm down.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.428" end="00:56:14.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me. My babies are there.</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.528" end="00:56:14.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you waiting for? BREAK IT DOWN.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.528" end="00:56:25.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HELP.</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.528" end="00:56:25.928" style="s2">Somebody save [music] Ava.</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.428" end="00:56:29.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Arthur. Ava.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.349" end="00:56:49.369" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.428" end="00:56:54.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ava.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.328" end="00:56:56.628" style="s2">Sweetheart, wake up.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.028" end="00:56:56.628" style="s2">Look at Mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.328" end="00:57:05.089" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET THE DOCTOR, NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.069" end="00:57:05.089" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.128" end="00:57:12.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; AVA.</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.328" end="00:57:12.529" style="s2">AVA IS MY REAL SISTER.</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.529" end="00:57:23.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MARGARET, I&#39;ve got questions for you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.529" end="00:57:24.829" style="s2">What? You want to keep interrogating me?</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.129" end="00:57:26.429" style="s2">Last night Arthur heard you say Avie</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.829" end="00:57:29.829" style="s2">isn&#39;t your real daughter. [music] Bianca</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.429" end="00:57:29.829" style="s2">is. You better start talking.</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.729" end="00:57:32.829" style="s2">Since you all heard I&#39;ve got nothing</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.929" end="00:57:34.329" style="s2">left to hide.</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.829" end="00:57:36.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I don&#39;t want this.</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.329" end="00:57:38.129" style="s2">I don&#39;t want Aunt Margaret as my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.129" end="00:57:39.829" style="s2">She&#39;s not my mother. I&#39;m the real lady</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.129" end="00:57:40.329" style="s2">of the Duke&#39;s estate.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.829" end="00:57:42.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca.</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.329" end="00:57:43.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. I&#39;m not your daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.729" end="00:57:45.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.629" end="00:57:47.729" style="s2">Fine. If you won&#39;t claim me then I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.529" end="00:57:49.129" style="s2">let everyone know the truth. 6 years ago</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.729" end="00:57:51.129" style="s2">Isabella and I gave birth [music] on the</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.129" end="00:57:54.729" style="s2">same day. When I found out my baby was</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.129" end="00:57:54.729" style="s2">cursed I had the two babies switched.</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.829" end="00:57:57.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.429" end="00:58:00.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You heard me. Avie is your real</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.229" end="00:58:01.329" style="s2">daughter. Bianca is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.229" end="00:58:03.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.329" end="00:58:05.429" style="s2">that mark I saw 6 years ago was real?</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.229" end="00:58:06.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was real. The Scratton mark on Avie&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.429" end="00:58:10.329" style="s2">forehead, THAT&#39;S YOUR REAL DAUGHTER&#39;S</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.829" end="00:58:10.329" style="s2">MARK. BIANCA IS MINE.</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.929" end="00:58:17.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My baby.</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.529" end="00:58:18.629" style="s2">Avie was my real daughter all along.</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.229" end="00:58:19.929" style="s2">Bianca, I did all this for you and you</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.629" end="00:58:21.629" style="s2">won&#39;t even claim your own mother?</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.929" end="00:58:22.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re lying. I&#39;m not your daughter. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.629" end="00:58:24.429" style="s2">the heiress of the Lamberts.</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.929" end="00:58:26.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s too late. You don&#39;t get a choice.</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.429" end="00:58:28.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. I said shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.329" end="00:58:29.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? You scared? You&#39;ve always hated</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.029" end="00:58:30.529" style="s2">Avie, haven&#39;t you? Bianca?</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.529" end="00:58:31.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, mother don&#39;t listen to her. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.529" end="00:58:32.729" style="s2">crazy. She&#39;s trying to set me up.</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.529" end="00:58:33.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me set you up? Morgan&#39;s business and</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.729" end="00:58:34.729" style="s2">what happened yesterday, you [music]</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.529" end="00:58:36.929" style="s2">knew all about it, didn&#39;t you? Right?</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.729" end="00:58:37.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. You shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.929" end="00:58:38.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew about all of this?</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.929" end="00:58:40.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all because of her. If she never</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.929" end="00:58:40.829" style="s2">came back I&#39;d still be the only lady of</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.029" end="00:58:41.429" style="s2">the Duke&#39;s estate. It should have all</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.829" end="00:58:43.129" style="s2">been mine.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.429" end="00:58:44.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still not sorry for anything, are you?</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.129" end="00:58:45.829" style="s2">You know what?</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.329" end="00:58:47.229" style="s2">Morgan said Avie was luck blessed and</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.829" end="00:58:49.329" style="s2">Bianca was born unlucky. [music] He was</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.229" end="00:58:50.929" style="s2">dead right. All these years I did</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.329" end="00:58:53.229" style="s2">everything for Bianca and she won&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.929" end="00:58:56.385" style="s2">claim me. What was it all for?</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.229" end="00:58:58.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take Margaret away. She&#39;s exiled.</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.385" end="00:59:00.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.229" end="00:59:01.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOTHER, I CARE.</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.329" end="00:59:03.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BIANCA,</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.529" end="00:59:06.529" style="s2">WHAT DO YOU HAVE TO SAY FOR YOURSELF?</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.729" end="00:59:07.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOTHER, I was wrong. Please forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.529" end="00:59:08.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bianca, I&#39;ve given you way too many</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.829" end="00:59:12.129" style="s2">chances.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.329" end="00:59:14.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, no. I really know I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.129" end="00:59:14.229" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.131" end="00:59:23.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avie, I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.331" end="00:59:24.551" style="s2">Mommy should have recognized you sooner.</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.031" end="00:59:25.731" style="s2">My sweet girl.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.551" end="00:59:28.531" style="s2">[snorts] Mommy&#39;s never letting anyone</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.731" end="00:59:28.531" style="s2">hurt you again.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.531" end="00:59:34.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take Bianca [music] to Sister Mary.</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.331" end="00:59:36.231" style="s2">She&#39;s not setting foot in this estate</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.631" end="00:59:37.031" style="s2">again without my permission.</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.231" end="00:59:40.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No!</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.031" end="00:59:40.926" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to go. Mother, please, just</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.331" end="00:59:42.946" style="s2">one more chance.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.926" end="00:59:42.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.231" end="00:59:53.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seeing Avie healthy again,</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.431" end="00:59:55.231" style="s2">I can finally breathe easily.</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.331" end="00:59:57.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After everything she&#39;s been through, all</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.231" end="00:59:59.331" style="s2">she needs to do now is enjoy her happy</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.131" end="01:00:01.231" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.331" end="01:00:03.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My little angel,</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.231" end="01:00:06.131" style="s2">you can finally grow up care free.</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.531" end="01:00:09.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, with you all here, Avie&#39;s happy</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.131" end="01:00:09.431" style="s2">every single day.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
